# SN77 QUADRATIC-drag variant (SIM_Frame). Identical to SN77.json except mdrag_coef=0:
# with momentum drag off, SIM_Frame's load-time split puts ALL of drag_force = mg*tan(refAngle)
# into the bluff-body term -> areaCd = drag_force/(0.5*rho(refAlt)*refSpd^2) ~ 0.1975 m^2,
# i.e. pure quadratic drag matching (k/m)|v|v at all speeds (SN77.json's mdrag_coef=0.2 trips
# the BCOEF=0 rescale branch -> momentum-only, LINEAR wind response with ~half the quadratic
# wind-delta gain at cruise). Use for judging the quadratic wind feed-forward (MPC_WIND_FF).
